      "id": "pf_9d998048_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "LIMITED WARRANTY: Kessick warrants the high quality and\rusability of the <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WinePanel</span>™ System and <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WineWall</span>™ System\r(the “Products”) for the extent of the Product’s life. This service\rprotects against any defects in materials or workmanship\rperformed by Kessick. Should a defect arise, contact us\rimmediately. “Defect” refers to, but is not limited to, occurrences of warping and bowing, splitting, or cracking of the of the\rbase-panel, as well as delamination of top panel or edge\rbanding. Kessick will replace the defective part or send a\rfull replacement.<br><br>Customer is responsible for notifying Kessick of defects\rbelieved to be covered by this Warranty within 10 days of\rreceiving the product. We reserve the right to inspect any\ritem for product failure and may request photographs of or\rthe return of the product. This Warranty is limited to the cost\rof repair or replacement of the defective item. It is advisable\rto inspect the Products once you have received them for\rany signs of defects in the Products themselves and the\rKessick-supplied hardware.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">What is Not Covered</span><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deterioration\ror malfunction resulting from the Customer’s handling or\rinstallation of the Products, or the removal of the Products\rfrom any installation, any unauthorized tampering with the\rProducts, any repairs attempted by anyone unauthorized\rby Kessick to make such repairs, or any other cause that\rdoes not relate directly to a defect in materials and/or\rworkmanship of the Products.<br><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deterioration\ror malfunction resulting from any alteration, modification,\rimproper or unreasonable use or maintenance, misuse,\rabuse, accident, neglect, exposure to excess moisture, fire,\rlightning, power surges, or other acts of nature.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Who is Covered</span><br>Only the original purchaser of the Products is covered under\rthis limited warranty. This limited warranty is not transferable\rto subsequent purchaser or owners of the Products.<br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br>How Kessick Will Help</span><br>Kessick will, at its sole discretion, provide one of the following\rthree remedies to whatever extent it shall deem necessary to\rsatisfy a proper claim under this limited warranty: 1. Elect to\rrepair or facilitate the repair of any defective parts within\ra reasonable period of time, free of any charge for the\rnecessary parts and labor to complete the repair and restore this product to its proper operating condition. Kessick will\ralso pay the shipping costs necessary to return this product\ronce the repair is complete. 2. Replace this product. 3. Issue\ra refund of the original purchase price less depreciation to\rbe determined based on the age of the product at the time\rremedy is sought under this limited warranty.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Obtaining a Remedy under this Limited Warranty</span><br>To obtain a remedy under this limited warranty, you must\reither contact the authorized Kessick distributor or our\roffices directly at sales@kessick.com. The return form must\ralso be filled out and returned with the product. This product\rshould be properly packed, preferably in the original carton,\rfor shipping."
