    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_a5f933b4_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WinePanel</span>™ System: The Wine Panel System is designed for installation of the back-panel directly to a vertical wall surface, using the Kessick-supplied wood screws, into a <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">wood framing structure</span>. If a wood framing structure is not available, “hollow wall anchors” can be used. Refer to the hollow wall anchors manufacturer’s instruction for proper and safe application. To that end, Kessick strongly advises the Customer to engage a licensed professional to install the Wine Panel System into any non-wood framed structure. <br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">WARNING: IMPROPER INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO FAILURE TO FOLLOW THE INSTALLATION GUIDE OR INSTALLATION VIDEO) MAY RESULT IN SERIOUS PERSONAL INJURY. INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM INTO ANY STRUCTURE\rOTHER THAN WOOD-FRAMING (INCLUDING\rBUT NOT LIMITED TO MASONRY, BRICK, BLOCK,\rCONCRETE, OR STONE) SHOULD BE PERFORMED\rBY A LICENSED PROFESSIONAL ONLY.</span>"
    },
